# Graph indexes (save tokens)

Two local graphs exist. Query them before Grep/Read loops.

## Codegraph (symbols, callers, blast radius)

Index: `.codegraph/` (gitignored). Pass `projectPath` `d:\Projects\DigitalPulse`.

Use `codegraph_explore` first for how X works, where a symbol lives, or impact of an edit. Treat returned source as already read.

If the index is missing or stale after large edits, run `codegraph init -y .` or `codegraph sync .`.

## Graphify (concepts, communities, docs ↔ code)

Outputs in `graphify-out/` (gitignored): `graph.json`, `GRAPH_REPORT.md`, `graph.html`.

For architecture, module relationships, or “what connects X to Y”:

```powershell
# BFS context
# follow graphify query in the graphify skill
```

Rebuild after large waves: `/graphify . --update` (code-only changes skip LLM). Do not re-read the master spec or whole `src/` tree when the graph already answers.

## Do not confuse with product Graphify

DigitalPulse **product** Graphify is `dp.GraphNode` / `dp.GraphEdge` (tenant business context for the AI orchestrator). It is not this repo graph.
